---
import { getBoughtCount } from '@/utils/column';
import Section from '@/components/astro/section';

import BenefitsCard from '~/benefit/widgets/benefits-card';

interface Props {
  class?: string;
}

const { class: customClass } = Astro.props;
const boughtCount = getBoughtCount();
---

<Section class:list={["text-center", customClass]} title="值得买吗？">
  <p class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">购买本专栏不是一次「消费」，而是对欧雷这个人进行「投资」，是否值得需要认真评估，下面给出一些参考：</p>
  <BenefitsCard class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-4" />
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p>还可查看<a href="https://meta.ourai.ws" target="_blank" rel="external">欧雷过往的其他产出</a>进行更细致的调研，然后</p>
    <p class="my-8"><a class="inline-block py-3 px-8 text-lg text-white bg-[#0871ab] rounded-full" href="/pricing">立即购入</a></p>
    <p>与另外 {boughtCount} 名小伙伴儿一起见证欧雷破局！</p>
  </div>
  <!-- <ul>
    <li>欧雷是谁</li>
    <li>欧雷的理念是什么</li>
    <li>欧雷宇宙是什么</li>
  </ul> -->
</Section>
